  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the visual material of melting chocolate",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material (chocolate_bars) as the subject of the meme's visual appeal and the implied target of the misleading claim. The user is invited to perceive the decadent, glossy melting chocolate as a representation of the stated fact, even though the fact is scientifically inaccurate. The projection is implicit, not deictic, but the user is positioned as the observer of the visual material that embodies the textual claim.",
